  "source": "desc",
  "source_value": "A simulated human user of the Personal Context Hub: a robot that behaves like a real person using the tool over time. It generates memories, contexts, preferences, projects, and other personal objects; feeds the vault; then searches, requests context, and consults briefs the way a human (or a Cursor-connected assistant acting for that human) would. The owner can watch each iteration and its results \u2014 what was written, what was queried, what came back \u2014 so they can see how the Hub behaves with a richer dataset behind it. Cursor plug-in is allowed if needed to exercise the real assistant path. This is a development and observation harness for the Hub owner, not an autonomous personal agent that plans and acts in the world.",
